added:        2026-10-08 by @XusBadia
notes:        Original work for this repository, derived from the FilmCraft app icon's art direction: the panel cover embeds the fork's own assets/app-icon/joose-clip.svg and the title embeds joose-clip-wordmark-dark.png (both original fork artwork, not copies). Text is outlined Inter / JetBrains Mono glyph paths. Used for the Finder window of the macOS DMG; packaging/macos/dmg/generate.py renders it to background.tiff. See packaging/macos/dmg/README.md.
